{"version":1,"content":"<p>朝中社今日（26日）報道，朝鮮常駐聯合國代表周日（25日）致信聯合國安理會主席，指韓國於9月21日就南部邊境線附近發生的可疑地雷爆炸事件，將責任無端轉嫁朝鮮，屬挑釁行為。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:25.605800+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":85,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T02:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T15:38:10.572197+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.536448+00:00","content_hash":"52b670ec5f520a31228fddc8e3529c48817a13c8615076e429ac0d7efb38f746","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}